# Internal/draft files that must never be part of the public deployment.
# These are not linked from any page nav, but Vercel's static file server
# will happily serve any file present in the deployment output at its exact
# path if it isn't excluded here — file-not-linked is not the same as
# file-not-reachable.
#
# email-audit.html and google-cloud-email-response.html were flagged CRITICAL
# / HIGH by the 2026-07-01 compliance audit: email-audit.html exposes dozens
# of real named third parties' (NIH/NSF/HHS/ARPA-H officials) direct email
# addresses from an internal investor-outreach tracking doc, and
# google-cloud-email-response.html exposes an internal draft business email
# with a real support case number. Neither belongs on a public site.
_internal-team-details.html
email-audit.html
google-cloud-email-response.html

# Confidential business documents — tracked in git but NOT web content and not
# linked from any page. An old investor pitch deck (.pptx) and business-plan
# white paper (.docx) must never be publicly downloadable at their exact paths.
PrecisionMedicine/

# Python test-suite (not web content).
tests/

# Never bundle local secrets into the serverless function (the api/run.py includeFiles
# glob packages ardia-studio-app/** — a local .env with a real key must not ride along).
.env
*.env
ardia-studio-app/.env

# Root-level confidential business documents. Same rule as PrecisionMedicine/
# above, which this list previously missed: these were tracked in git, not
# linked from any page, and still served at their exact paths (verified HTTP 200
# on the live site). Three of them carried the founder's personal name, which
# must not appear anywhere on the website; the investor database and outreach
# document also carry third parties' contact details. None is web content.
Ardia_Health_Business_Plan_2026_v2.docx
Ardia_Health_Pitch_Deck_2026_v2.pptx
Ardia_Investor_Outreach_Emails_2026.docx
Ardia_Investor_Database_2026.xlsx
Ardia_Health_Investor_Pitch_Deck.pptx
Ardia_Health_White_Paper_Business_Plan.docx
Ardia_Health_White_Paper_Business_Plan (1).docx

# NOTE: Ardia-Precision-Health-Deck.pdf is deliberately PUBLIC (its URL is given
# out in applications) and must stay served. Do not add it here.
